  "description": "Raised under the oppression of a patriarchal household, Gamin marries a client's employee against her father's wishes. However, just two months into their marriage, her husband dies in a car accident—along with his 'legal spouse.' \n\nOvernight, Gamin finds herself a victim of a fraudulent marriage and branded an adulteress. To bury the pain, she becomes an accountant and decides to start fresh in a rural town. But there, she frequently witnesses 'office affairs' and begins to be drawn into that world. She falls into a risky, passionate affair with her boss, Jungeun, who has also experienced a failed marriage.\n\n In this relationship, free from commitment and obligations, where they keep a certain distance and enjoy only a physical bond—perhaps this relationship, which cannot be spoken of to others, is the most 'safe relationship' of all?\n\n**Original Webtoon:**   \n[Naver Webtoon](https://comic.naver.com/webtoon/list?titleId=852309), [Naver Series](https://series.naver.com/comic/detail.series?productNo=14340388)",
